# Schema Fleet

## Class Diagram

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction TB
    class Person {
        id UUID
        name String
        age Integer
    }
    class Car {
        vin String
        color Enum
    }
    class Wheel {
        <<Part>>
        position Enum
    }
    Car --> Person : OWNER (one)
    Car *-- Wheel : WHEELS (one:many)
```

## Types

### Person

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | `UUID` | primary |  |
| `name` | `String[1, 100]` | required |  |
| `age` | `Integer[0, 150]` |  |  |

### Car

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `vin` | `String` | primary |  |
| `color` | `Enum["red", "green"]` |  |  |

**Associations**

- `--> OWNER (one)` [Person](#person)

**Compositions**

- `*-> WHEELS (one:many)` [Wheel](#wheel)

### Wheel

*Part type* — instances exist only as composed children.

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `position` | `Enum["FL", "FR", "RL", "RR"]` | required |  |
